.
For information on the availability of this material at NARA, email
fr.inspection@nara.gov
or go to
www.archives.gov/federal-register/cfr/ibr-locations.html
.
It is available from: The International Telecommunications Union, Telecommunications Standardization Bureau, Place des Nations, CH-1211 Geneva 20; (+41 22 730 5852);
https://www.itu.int/en//default.aspx
.
